{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../cli/", "title": "CLI"}, "next": null, "title": "Web Interface", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"web-interface\">\n<h1>Web Interface<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#web-interface\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Read-only HTTP server exposing the orchestrator state (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">pyorchestrate-web</span></code>).\nRequires the <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">web</span></code> extra: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">pip</span> <span class=\"pre\">install</span> <span class=\"pre\">&quot;PyOrchestrate[web]&quot;</span></code>.</p>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-web-interface-server\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>HTTP Server for PyOrchestrate Web Interface</p>\n<p>Provides a REST API that exposes orchestrator data in read-only mode.\nCommunicates with the orchestrator via ZeroMQ using the same\nprotocol as the CLI.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">WebServerConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">host</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'127.0.0.1'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">port</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">8000</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_path</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'tcp://127.0.0.1:5555'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">enable_auth</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_token</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cors_origins</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">['http://localhost:3000',</span> <span class=\"pre\">'http://127.0.0.1:3000']</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseModel</span></code></p>\n<p>Configuration for the web server.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>host</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>port</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>socket_path</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>enable_auth</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>auth_token</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>cors_origins</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.List\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>List</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.host\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">host</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.host\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.port\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">port</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.port\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.socket_path\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_path</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.socket_path\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.enable_auth\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">enable_auth</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.enable_auth\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.auth_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_token</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.auth_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.cors_origins\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cors_origins</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.List\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">List</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.cors_origins\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.model_config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">model_config</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">ClassVar</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">ConfigDict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">{}</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig.model_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Configuration for the model, should be a dictionary conforming to [<cite>ConfigDict</cite>][pydantic.config.ConfigDict].</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.OrchestratorClient\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">socket_path</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.OrchestratorClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Client for communicating with the orchestrator via ZeroMQ.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>socket_path</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.OrchestratorClient.send_command\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send_command</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">command</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.OrchestratorClient.send_command\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Send a command to the orchestrator and return the response.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>command</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.List\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>List</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>] </em><em>| </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Dict</em></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Any</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_pretty_json_response\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_pretty_json_response</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">data</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_pretty_json_response\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create a pretty-formatted JSON response.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>data</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Dict</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>, </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Any</em></a><em>]</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>JSONResponse</em></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_html_response\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_html_response</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">title</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">data</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">endpoint</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">is_stats</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">show_filters</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">current_params</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_html_response\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create an HTML response with syntax-highlighted JSON.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>title</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>data</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Dict</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>, </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Any</em></a><em>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>endpoint</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_stats</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>show_filters</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>current_params</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Dict</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>, </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Any</em></a><em>] </em><em>| </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>HTMLResponse</em></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.PyOrchestrateWebServer\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrateWebServer</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.PyOrchestrateWebServer\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Main web server class.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\"><em>WebServerConfig</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.PyOrchestrateWebServer.run\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">run</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.PyOrchestrateWebServer.run\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Run the web server.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_app\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_app</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.create_app\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Factory function to create the FastAPI app.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.WebServerConfig\"><em>WebServerConfig</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><em>FastAPI</em></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.main\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.web_interface.server.</span></span>